<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1388].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1388&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ACC8 MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NH<sub>4</sub>Cl  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.54 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.14 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;3.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.15 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> FeCl<sub>2</sub> solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=187">187</a>)  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace element solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=187">187</a>)  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Selenite-tungstate solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=431">431</a>)  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaHCO<sub>3</sub>  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.5 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Resazurin  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components, except NaHCO<sub>3</sub>, and adjust pH 7.0. Bring to a boil for 5-10 seconds, then, cool down under a stream of N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (80:20, v/v), add NaHCO<sub>3</sub>, and autoclave under the same gas mixture. After cooling. aseptically and anaerobically, add the following solutions (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized, and stored under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere): <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace vitamins* (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=197">197</a>)  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1.0 M Sodium pyruvate solution  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 10 ml in Hungate tubes) under the same gas mixture and seal with butyl rubber stoppers. Finally, add per liter the following solutions (autoclaved and stored under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere): <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 5% L-Cysteine&#183;HCl&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O solution  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 5% Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H2O solution  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml        </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
